{"about_the_game":"Push, slice, ingest, flip, and squish worms in this puzzle game in which you play as a little sentient tin can.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1295320/extras/e834bc8056161845c5ce79b1a00924fe.poster.avif?t=1709174577\" width=616 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1295320/extras/e834bc8056161845c5ce79b1a00924fe.webm?t=1709174577\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1295320/extras/e834bc8056161845c5ce79b1a00924fe.mp4?t=1709174577\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The puzzles in this game are an exploration of how far the interactions between a seemingly simple collection of objects can be taken. Each puzzle is designed to teach a new idea or interaction that was hidden in plain sight all along.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1295320/extras/20c764f35ef5e589ff773e770a3d2a53.poster.avif?t=1709174577\" width=616 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1295320/extras/20c764f35ef5e589ff773e770a3d2a53.webm?t=1709174577\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1295320/extras/20c764f35ef5e589ff773e770a3d2a53.mp4?t=1709174577\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Gameplay features</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Over 100 hand crafted puzzle stages.<br></li><li>No filler content! Every puzzle introduces a new idea or interaction.<br></li><li>An interactive over world connects the puzzle stages together and holds puzzles of its own.<br></li><li>Unlimited undos and restarts.<br></li><li>A playable hint system. Every stage has an optional alternative mini-stage designed to tease out the key insight required to solve that puzzle.</li></ul><br><strong>Accessibility notes</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Game is fully playable with keyboard or gamepad (Gamepad not supported on Mac at present).<br></li><li>No mouse input is required.<br></li><li>No time critical inputs are required.<br></li><li>No simultaneous key presses are required.<br></li><li>Hearing impaired friendly.<br></li><li>Colorblind friendly.</li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"b3fd9e6bc8406171573137673151f1ac3b081ce4.jpg","localized_name":"Juicy","name":"Juicy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1295320/b3fd9e6bc8406171573137673151f1ac3b081ce4.jpg"},{"icon":"78d7aaf2a8ac2d216fd645d7ad84824652d37664.jpg","localized_name":"Tumbler","name":"Tumbler","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1295320/78d7aaf2a8ac2d216fd645d7ad84824652d37664.jpg"},{"icon":"021deffc859992b77eed3633a7184499ac945120.jpg","localized_name":"Sharper than expected","name":"Sharper than expected","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1295320/021deffc859992b77eed3633a7184499ac945120.jpg"},{"icon":"693429bdcf9c0c2b53718cc411510df7a01bca12.jpg","localized_name":"I've been eating what?","name":"I've been eating what?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1295320/693429bdcf9c0c2b53718cc411510df7a01bca12.jpg"},{"icon":"822030e50d76f837db5d39f1be90c5a397b565a3.jpg","localized_name":"Under and over","name":"Under and over","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1295320/822030e50d76f837db5d39f1be90c5a397b565a3.jpg"},{"icon":"5a2d84b1f661f31137f701800dc65d64014e857a.jpg","localized_name":"Bridge the gap","name":"Bridge the gap","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1295320/5a2d84b1f661f31137f701800dc